# =============================================================================
# TruthCart AI -- Environment Variables Template
# =============================================================================
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values (never commit .env itself).
#
# CURRENT STATUS: This application requires NO external API keys or secrets.
# All configuration is read from YAML files under config/.
#
# If you add external services in future iterations, document them here:
# =============================================================================

# Example (not currently used):
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./data/build/truthcart.sqlite
# CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,https://yourdomain.com
